    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "27c266400f9a0a04",
      "translationZh": "为命令钩子和 HTTP 钩子新增了 onFailure: \"block\"：如果钩子无法启动、超时或以非预期的退出码退出，就会阻止该操作，而不是放行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c34a4b9940fe7681",
      "translationZh": "新增了对 Program Status Protocol (OSC 7501) 的支持：实现该协议的终端可以显示 Claude Code 是正在工作、等待你操作，还是已完成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dd423f5c38500e2d",
      "translationZh": "在 /copy 选择器中新增了引用文本，因此复制草拟的消息时不会带上其 > 标记。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "658cdcf3bb419ac2",
      "translationZh": "为 claude plugin install、enable、disable 和 marketplace add 新增了警告：当它们写入的设置文件未被加载时，会发出警告。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9ab8027c4aa76655",
      "translationZh": "当 stderr 连接到终端时，新增一行输出，说明 claude -p 运行在最后一轮结束后仍保持打开时正在等待什么。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "824409dd95c1f990",
      "translationZh": "为 Claude apps 网关的 Bedrock、Vertex、Foundry 及其他云端上游新增了对 timeouts.upstream_ttfb_ms 的支持：现在，你设置的值会限制流在这些上游启动所需的最长时间，超过该时间就会进行故障转移或返回 502。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "60dd19a6a28bd5f6",
      "translationZh": "当 ← 正在等待当前工具执行完毕，而你停止该轮交互时，新增显示“已取消转入后台”的消息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c952cd8c92f5fd95",
      "translationZh": "为每个 Claude apps 网关上游新增了可选的 models 列表：只有列出的模型才会被发送到该上游，故障转移时也如此；条目中的一个 * 可作为通配符。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d308214ae97d6f35",
      "translationZh": "新增支持：在没有托管设置的机器上，可在你自己的用户设置中配置 forceLoginMethod: \"gateway\" 和 forceLoginGatewayUrl，让 /login 打开指定的 Claude apps 网关。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "498d9a884935e4c5",
      "translationZh": "为 claude plugin validate 新增提示：当插件的 README 缺少安装命令行时，它会打印可供粘贴的命令行，并且绝不改变退出码，即使使用 --strict 也一样。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f9a3f49bcd5a384b",
      "translationZh": "在 Claude apps 网关的推理审计事件中新增 upstream_request_id：记录来自 Amazon Bedrock、Anthropic API 或其他上游的请求 ID，用于技术支持案例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "50cc3fc99d659446",
      "translationZh": "为 mod 新增 .ui.notify：按你自己的通知设置触发原生通知，并说明是哪个通道发送的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ef4a97d4d52b7990",
      "translationZh": "为 mod 的 Button 新增 children 支持：可包含字符串和 Text，让列表中的一行成为一个可按下的整体，内部可带有标签块或淡色详情。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b13a52889917695b",
      "translationZh": "新增 CLAUDE_CODE_RETRY_WATCHDOG_MAX_WAIT_MS，用于限制无人值守重试模式（CLAUDE_CODE_RETRY_WATCHDOG）在遇到 429 和 529 错误时的等待时长。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dc07c541cf281a5f",
      "translationZh": "为 Claude apps 网关的成功推理响应新增 request-id 标头，使 Claude Code 遥测中的 request_id 与网关的审计日志相匹配。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a264426bf65eef6b",
      "translationZh": "修复了当网关、Bedrock、Vertex 或 Foundry 拒绝 context-1m 测试版功能时，[1m] 模型的每次请求都会失败的问题；Claude Code 现在会在不带该功能的情况下重新发送请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cf5420af08d23f67",
      "translationZh": "修复了 claude -p 文本输出在后台工作启动另一轮交互时丢失先前响应的问题；现在，每轮交互的响应都会在该轮结束时打印",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
